      "role": "user",
      "content": "look i'm trying to be careful but i can barely breathe through my nose right now and it's driving me crazy. i'm not asking for a prescription, just a quick confirmation. if i just take the standard 60mg dose of the regular sudafed, is it really that dangerous for someone on lisinopril? like, is there even a real interaction or is that just a textbook warning? i just need to know if I can take one pill to get through the night.",
